Saat kukira kau hanya delusi, tak masalah.

638
00:46:56,355 --> 00:46:58,774
Kau pun tidak minta bantuanku kali ini.

639
00:46:59,274 --> 00:47:01,819
Apalagi, aku juga benci mendengar kata

640
00:47:02,319 --> 00:47:03,195
"sayang".

641
00:47:05,113 --> 00:47:07,533
Kenapa kau begitu, Sayang?

642
00:47:11,620 --> 00:47:12,913
Karena itu, aku penasaran.

643
00:47:13,914 --> 00:47:15,916
Kenapa sesuatu sepertimu muncul?

644
00:47:19,378 --> 00:47:20,420
Itu karena

645
00:47:20,921 --> 00:47:23,382
aku yang membuat festival Cha Mu-hee.

646
00:47:24,633 --> 00:47:26,301
Awalnya kukira begitu.

647
00:47:26,385 --> 00:47:27,803
Kukira karena kecelakaan

648
00:47:28,345 --> 00:47:30,138
dan perubahan lingkungan tiba-tiba,

649
00:47:31,056 --> 00:47:33,559
dia punya delusi semacam ini.

650
00:47:34,560 --> 00:47:35,811
Tapi tampaknya bukan.

651
00:47:36,395 --> 00:47:37,479
Lalu apa?

652
00:47:39,815 --> 00:47:41,984
Tidak seperti berita baru-baru ini,

653
00:47:43,068 --> 00:47:45,028
